{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"f4f6f565672a4acfa8cafbd9a62622de","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"027a8d09a4fc5a49c2a9861a2038aa7224df","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=027a8d09a4fc5a49c2a9861a2038aa7224df","view_num":498,"pub_timestamp":"1710971613","title":"3월 21일 업데이트 개선사항(3/21 내용 수정)","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=027a8d09a4fc5a49c2a9861a2038aa7224df","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"97bccdecbed90f25ccb6fe64df28dcd6\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[모바일\u0026amp;PC\u0026nbsp;공통\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;SR과\u0026nbsp;RL\u0026nbsp;무기로\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;즉시\u0026nbsp;갱신되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;성능은\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;전투중\u0026nbsp;목단이\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;불능\u0026nbsp;상태일\u0026nbsp;때,\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;HP가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;표시되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;전투중\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;보호막\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;공격을\u0026nbsp;막지\u0026nbsp;못하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;티아\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「도마뱀의\u0026nbsp;보호」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아리아\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「아리아\u0026nbsp;디\u0026nbsp;캄포」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;니케의\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;적에게\u0026nbsp;표시된\u0026nbsp;타깃\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;사라지지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;랩쳐의\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명에\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;효과에\u0026nbsp;대한\u0026nbsp;설명을\u0026nbsp;추가하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6. 캐릭터와 코스튬에 관계없이 엄폐 기능이 통일감 있게 작동하도록 개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;조준\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;니케의\u0026nbsp;총기가\u0026nbsp;보이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e컨텐츠/시스템\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;루키\u0026nbsp;아레나\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나에\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e빠른\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아레나\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;입장\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;바로\u0026nbsp;결과\u0026nbsp;화면이\u0026nbsp;출력됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;리플레이를\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;과정을\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;토커티브의\u0026nbsp;사망\u0026nbsp;연출\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;토커티브가\u0026nbsp;보이지\u0026nbsp;않게되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;픽의\u0026nbsp;룰렛\u0026nbsp;연출을\u0026nbsp;스킵할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;기업별\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;성장\u0026nbsp;포인트의\u0026nbsp;달성\u0026nbsp;단계가\u0026nbsp;확장되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;이벤트의\u0026nbsp;메신저\u0026nbsp;확인\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;조건에서\u0026nbsp;오류\u0026nbsp;메시지가\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;필드\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;유실물\u0026nbsp;힌트\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;재생되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;협동작전의\u0026nbsp;파티\u0026nbsp;멤버가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;표시되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;Miracle\u0026nbsp;Snow\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;필드의\u0026nbsp;폭죽\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;재생시에도\u0026nbsp;들리는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;상세\u0026nbsp;페이지에서\u0026nbsp;뒤로가기를\u0026nbsp;선택할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;Voice\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;진입하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;로스트\u0026nbsp;섹터\u0026nbsp;EX-05\u0026nbsp;섹터를\u0026nbsp;정상적으로\u0026nbsp;진행하지\u0026nbsp;못하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e11.\u0026nbsp;다음\u0026nbsp;기간\u0026nbsp;동안\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나의\u0026nbsp;그룹\u0026nbsp;재편성이\u0026nbsp;진행됩니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;27일\u0026nbsp;05:00:00\u0026nbsp;~\u0026nbsp;3월\u0026nbsp;28일\u0026nbsp;04:59:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;내\u0026nbsp;확률에\u0026nbsp;따라\u0026nbsp;결과를\u0026nbsp;얻을\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠의\u0026nbsp;확률\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;UI를\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e13.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e스테이지\u0026nbsp;완료\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;프로필\u0026nbsp;선택\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;지휘관\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;확인할수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e14.\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;목록\u0026nbsp;화면을\u0026nbsp;통해\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;진입\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;되돌아올\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;로비에\u0026nbsp;배치한\u0026nbsp;월페이퍼의\u0026nbsp;음성이\u0026nbsp;재생되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e15.\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;임시\u0026nbsp;합류\u0026nbsp;정보\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;바로가기\u0026nbsp;기능을\u0026nbsp;사용할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;정보가\u0026nbsp;저장되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e16.\u0026nbsp;솔로레이드\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;유저\u0026nbsp;테두리가\u0026nbsp;닉네임과\u0026nbsp;유니온\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;가리고\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e기타\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;랭킹\u0026nbsp;목표\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;정보를\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;확인할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;UI를\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;개조\u0026nbsp;장비의\u0026nbsp;[효과\u0026nbsp;변경]\u0026nbsp;또는\u0026nbsp;[수치\u0026nbsp;재설정]\u0026nbsp;버튼을\u0026nbsp;선택\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;잘못된\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;재생되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;SD모델의\u0026nbsp;동작을\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;자연스러워\u0026nbsp;보이도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstron